    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d730">

                <pb facs="0705" n="539" sameAs="frus:frus1917/pg539"/>

                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Minister Swenson to the Secretary of State </hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#float-left">No. 260</seg>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">American Legation</hi>, <lb/>
                            <hi rendition="#italic">Copenhagen</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1902-06-04">
                            <hi rendition="#italic">June 4, 1902</hi></date>.</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>
                    <hi rendition="#small-caps">Sir</hi>: I have the honor to forward, under
                    separate cover, for the files of the Department, copies of public documents
                    relating to the ratification of the treaty for the cession of the Danish West
                    Indies to the United States.<anchor n="8" xml:id="d730-f1"/>
                </p>
                <p>These documents embrace the diplomatic correspondence submitted to the Rigsdag by
                    the Danish Foreign Office; the committee reports <pb facs="0706" n="540"
                        xml:id="pg540"/> and resolutions of the Rigsdag; and verbatim reports of the
                    debates in the two houses on the question of ratification.</p>
                <p>I will thank you to favor this office with similar documents published by the
                    Government of the United States.</p>
                <p>I have [etc.]</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Laurits S. Swenson</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
